== Description ==

'''Iron Arrowhead''' is a crafted component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 5 downstream recipes at the [[Carpentry Workbench]], including [[Spiked Great Trunk]], [[Single Spear Spike]], [[Spiked Trunk]], [[Spear Spike]], [[Bladed Pole]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

